<p>The pattern is stable even when the domain names change. Someone claims the rank list on the official site is “provisional” and that a final rank will be sent after a fee. Someone offers a reserved seat in a private college for a token amount, with the balance due before the allotment letter. Someone circulates a screenshot of a rank that is one digit off from yours and asks you to “verify” by sharing the application password. None of that is how NBEMS or MCC publishes an outcome.</p>
