<p>There is a second reason the query is sticky. The series is being read, including by Sky, as preparation for the 2027 men’s Cricket World Cup, which that report placed in South Africa, Namibia and Zimbabwe. A home ODI win against Australia, with several frontline South African quicks missing — Nine said four of them were absent, without listing the names in the passage we used — is the sort of result that gets forwarded into Indian cricket groups even when India is not playing. The forward often drops the opponent, the city, or the format. This page puts them back.</p>
