<p>The third ODI’s city and date were not in the Sky or Nine pieces we relied on. A three-match series has a third game. Naming a ground for it from memory would be the kind of error this site is trying not to ship. Read the series page from Cricket South Africa or Cricket Australia before you book around a third date.</p>
